-- logits.psk — an entry that returns a tensor
-- (`crates/presk-cli/tests/solve_tensor.rs`). `presk calibrate` takes it
-- (D101), and since 0.12.0 `presk solve` does too, under a budget on its
-- largest elementwise gap, relative (`--budget`) or absolute
-- (`--budget-abs`); until then it refused it before computing anything,
-- since it ranked the sites by `∂L/∂v` for a scalar `L`.
fn logits(x : ℝ[8]) -> ℝ[8] = exp(x * real(2))
